  "sourceTitle": "Thai Peanut Sauce For Shrimp",
  "sourceText": "Thai Peanut Sauce For Shrimp\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Monday, November 30, 2009 - 11:33pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 tablespoon minced garlic\n2 tablespoons minced cilantro\n1 tablespoon ginger, minced\n1 tablespoon mint, minced\n1/4 cup peanut butter\n2 tablespoons oriental fish sauce\n2 tablespoons sugar\n1 tablespoon red pepper flakes\n1/4 cup olive oil\n1/4 cup soy sauce\n2 tablespoons honey\n1 pt. cream\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Combine all ingredients except honey and cream. Add honey and cream to taste to cut saltiness. Serve with shrimp or scallops sauteed with ginger, garlic, salt and pepper. Makes about 2 1/2 cups of sauce.",
